Adding Omeka in the VM

I ran into an error with Omeka when I was trying to install it. 
After setting everything up in Omeka and attempting to do the webpage portion, I was receiving an error page with no number just saying "Omeka has encountered an error". 
I thought I had perhaps set up my permissions incorrectly at first, but everything looked correct there. 
I had to go back and make a new copy of my db.ini file because I had been editing the copied version and I needed to edit the db.ini file. 
Omeka runs the db.ini file, not the copied version that we make. Definitely an ah-ha kind of moment for me. 
After I did that, everything started right up on Omeka. 
